# Test-only stand-in for acpi-backend.svc's register endpoint (tests/headless,
# acpi-hardware): registers role 35 ("acpi-registers") exactly as the backend
# will and reports the badge every request carries. Never part of a
# production image: procmgr lets com.cubit.acpi-backend register only from
# the startup plan.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi-backend"
  version => "0.0.1"
  requests => [
    (notification "acpi-registers" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")])
